00:43:36.950 --> 00:43:38.950
The service controls are
kind of great addition.

00:43:38.950 --> 00:43:40.870
They're providing
great capabilities

00:43:40.870 --> 00:43:43.330
to get you to the next
level of security.

00:43:43.330 --> 00:43:45.760
And think about layering
on partner solutions

00:43:45.760 --> 00:43:47.875
